VOICE
- Synthetic narration.

MUSIC AND SOUND (original score and procedural foley in demo/mix.py)
- Sampled instruments: horn, trombone, timpani, bass drum, cellos, glockenspiel, marimba, vibraphone (soft, hard, bowed),
  harp, tubular bells, gran cassa, glass harp.
- Synthesis and foley (pad, pulse bass, metal ticks, acrylic toks, punch, air, room tone): numpy/scipy, written for this film.

